
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Kingdom of Flora.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Kingdom of Flora.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"khh9kw","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777071379120,"size":1904,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"khh9kw"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,27],"#Nations - The Kingdom of Flora":[29,37],"#Nations - The Kingdom of Flora#{1}":[31,37]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":120,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["flora","kingdom","queendom","world info","setting","nisra"],"position":"after","depth":4,"scanDepth":"1\n**The Kingdom of Flora** is a matriarchal aristocratic nation on the continent of Nisra. Its society and politics are defined by female supremacy, rooted in the dominant Faith of Althena (Mother Goddess).\n**Select this entry** when Flora is mentioned as a nation, a political actor, or in contexts involving its cold war with the patriarchal **Kingdom of Duran**, its undeclared naval war with the expansionist **Skaag Empire**, or internal noble house intrigue.\n**Key relationships:** - **Kingdom of Duran** – ideological enemy (cold war). - **Skaag Empire** – active military rival (naval war). - **Faith of Althena** – state religion underpinning political system.","summary":"**The Kingdom of Flora:** A matriarchal aristocratic nation on the Nisra continent. Its social hierarchy and religion (Faith of Althena) enforce female supremacy.\n\n**When to select:** When the scene involves noble houses, political maneuvering, or conflicts with Duran (cold war) or the Skaag Empire (undeclared naval war). Select for characters discussing state religion, gender roles, or high-society intrigue.\n\n**Key relationships:** Opposes the patriarchal Kingdom of Duran; resists the expansionist Skaag Empire."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Kingdom of Flora.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"9rcbvk","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Kingdom of Flora.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,27],"size":1408,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
