ena) enforce female supremacy.\n\n**When to select:** When the scene involves noble houses, political maneuvering, or conflicts with Duran (cold war) or the Skaag Empire (undeclared naval war). Select for characters discussing state religion, gender roles, or high-society intrigue.\n\n**Key relationships:** Opposes the patriarchal Kingdom of Duran; resists the expansionist Skaag Empire."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Kingdom of Flora.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"9rcbvk","at":1777331881594},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[0.01603544,0.04983038,0.07765627,-0.02402133,0.04008111,0.01315382,0.06608193,-0.03180941,-0.02401077,0.04588252,-0.00520272,-0.06253314,0.00928883,-0.01165057,0.0434865,-0.02188991,-0.0274028,0.04482161,-0.08150145,0.09952,0.08492173,-0.05666614,0.00339864,0.01096004,-0.01111507,0.00090892,-0.01816691,-0.04370724,-0.06337187,-0.17185004,-0.06474433,-0.01221318,0.0156794,0.05365736,-0.03153633,0.02522892,-0.09765741,0.01993102,-0.06012888,-0.00109466,0.04660003,0.00920582,0.0288793,0.00739647,0.01642257,-0.05839702,-0.03788579,0.0136115,-0.07825758,-0.06448033,-0.02761399,-0.00209354,-0.04541855,-0.00385785,0.06746881,0.02097078,0.04606026,0.04005451,0.10732137,0.01638032,0.07200325,0.00653819,-0.2081828,0.09722529,0.00198228,0.03661833,0.00688778,-0.00852533,0.00081374,-0.01187173,-0.00860669,0.02655955,-0.00441609,0.04297946,-0.00356635,0.04744949,-0.0139484,-0.07455269,-0.02497104,-0.02951923,-0.03964256,0.08136956,-0.05214423,-0.01015981,0.01817835,-0.01525686,-0.03829655,-0.05635305,0.00887922,0.03307308,-0.01125683,-0.02934527,0.07733436,-0.00179884,0.00050589,0.02621017,-0.03362609,0.00762717,0.01991653,0.1023344,0.02488078,0.03573556,0.01719215,0.04011835,0.10166463,-0.00925655,-0.04259943,-0.04109425,-0.0474045,0.04956491,0.01337127,-0.03831585,-0.07182066,-0.04132824,-0.00052139,-0.08353055,0.08934847,-